audit_log_filter_set_filter('filter_broken_unknownEventKey', '{"filter": { "class": [ { "name": "connection", "event": { "name": "connect", "logg": true } } ] } }')
ERROR: Incorrect rule definition: unexpected key 'logg' in 'event' definition
